e button next to 'CONFIRM SELECTION', displays options to show/hide columns or apply additional filters: 'Time Range', 'Organisation/s', 'EAGLE Elements' (checked), '100% EAGLE Compliant' (checked), 'Extraction/s', and 'INSPIRE Themes'.)
